You asked to reserve apartment {0} at {1}.
Nothing is held yet, and the apartment is still on sale. Follow this link to hold it: {2}
The link works until {3}. If it was not you who asked, ignore this email — nothing has been reserved in your name and nothing has been charged.

The hold on apartment {0} at {1} has run out, and it has returned to sale.

If you are still interested, see what is available here:
{2}

Apartment {0} at {1} has just returned to sale, and you are next on the waiting list.

It is available to anyone, so it will go to whoever reserves first:
{2}

You are number {2} on the waiting list for {0} at {1}.
We will email you as soon as one comes free. It will be open to anyone at that point, so being told first is the advantage, not a reservation.
See your place, or take yourself off the list, here: {3}

You asked us for: {0}

We have until {1} to answer, and we will write to you before then.

We may ask you to confirm who you are first. Anyone can type an email address into a form, and we are not going to hand over somebody's details, or delete them, on that alone.
